{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach, grab, check, move, and do specific task. Otherwise, scan or wander. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = WanderAround    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
